# Token Optimizer (Cursor)

alexgreensh/token-optimizer, Cursor beta adapter. Source `~/.cursor/tools/token-optimizer-src`; payload `~/.cursor/token-optimizer/plugin/`. License PolyForm Noncommercial: personal use only.

- `measure.py cursor-summary` for per-session tokens/quality; `cursor-doctor` for readiness.
- Its accounting hooks (sessionStart, postToolUse, preCompact, stop, sessionEnd) are wired. RTK owns the Shell preToolUse; do not re-add Token Optimizer's.
- After any reinstall, run `~/.cursor/tools/token-optimizer-src/de-collide-rtk.sh`.
- Cost figures are not billing truth: Cursor exposes no cost, so it reports `cursor_no_cost_data`.
